                                    <span class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-[length:0.6rem] font-extrabold flex inline-flex items-center gap-1"><span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>Active</span>
